     tooltip="Floor on how close the stop may sit. Without it, a tight recent low produced an enormous R that passed the minimum-R filter automatically — rewarding the stops most likely to be taken out.")
float riskMinR  = input.float(1.5, "Minimum R to Show Signal", minval=0.0, maxval=10.0, group=G_RISK,
