     tooltip="Nothing used to stop a BUY firing while a SELL was still open, so the chart could show you a long and a short at once with their stop and target boxes overlapping — two contradictory instructions, which is worse than none.\n\nWith this ON no new signal is drawn while a trade is still live.")
